  "body": "Be In For Christmas!  The current owners have found their next home and are ready to go!  \r\n\r\nBeautifully maintained and thoughtfully designed, this home delivers generous family living, incredible privacy and a flexible 210sqm layout, all on one level and set well back from the road in an elevated Millwater location.\r\n\r\nTop property features you'll love:\r\n• Four generous bedrooms, including two master suites with external access\r\n• Three fully tiled bathrooms\r\n• Entertainer's kitchen with walk-in pantry and built-in bar area\r\n• Media room or second lounge\r\n• Excellent separation between bedrooms and living spaces\r\n• Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to entertaining decks and a flat lawn\r\n• Exceptionally private covered outdoor spaces, perfect for children and pets\r\n• Ducted heating and cooling throughout\r\n• Double internal-access garage\r\n• Additional parking for the boat, caravan or extra vehicles\r\n\r\nThere's so much to love about this home, but it's the layout that really sets it apart. With two master suites, three bathrooms and multiple living spaces, there's room for everyone to enjoy their own space while still feeling connected. Whether you're accommodating extended family, guests or teenagers wanting a little independence, the flexibility here is a real bonus.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the kitchen is an entertainer's dream, complete with a walk-in pantry and built-in bar area. Generous open-plan living flows effortlessly to outdoor entertaining decks and a flat lawn, creating a fantastic space for family gatherings, summer barbecues and kids or pets to play.\r\n\r\nThe privacy is exceptional. Sheltered from neighbouring properties and set well back from the road, it's a wonderfully peaceful setting, with the added practicality of a double internal-access garage and plenty of space for the boat or caravan.\r\n\r\nThe location completes the family package.  Within walking distance of popular schools, including Silverdale Primary and KingsWay, you also have Millwater's local shops and cafés close by, along with the estuary walkway, parks and sports fields. \r\n\r\nBeautifully presented and ready for its next owners to enjoy, this is a home that ticks so many boxes for modern family living.\r\nIf space, privacy and flexibility are high on your wish list, 7 Frontiere Lane deserves a closer look.",
